  <p id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001:m0000" ref="ch7_egc_g3g">瓊</persName>勁烈有將略，歷數郡，代<persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001:m0012" ref="gcz_gee_ro1">楊亮</persName>爲梁州刺史、建武將軍，領西戎校尉。初，氏人<persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001:m0035" ref="jek_c7o_d0g">竇沖</persName>求降，朝廷以爲東羌校尉。後<persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001:m0050" ref="jek_c7o_d0g">沖</persName>反，欲入漢中，安定人<persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001:m0061" ref="ym3_3l3_0re">皇甫釗</persName>、京兆人<persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001:m0068" ref="y91_8bm_g2i">周勳</persName>等謀納沖，<persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001:m0075" ref="ch7_egc_g3g">瓊</persName>密知之，收釗、勳等斬之。尋卒。子<persName id="c-jinshu-058-zhou-qiong:p001:m0092" ref="pqa_k01_mx5">虓</persName>嗣。</p>
</text>
